293
00:14:02,560 --> 00:14:04,620
I'll give you an age-gap friendship.

294
00:14:05,160 --> 00:14:06,040
Mr. Heying.

295
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:10,200
Xiaoqi.

296
00:14:11,400 --> 00:14:12,730
You're working out too.

297
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:36,560
Mr. Heying.

298
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:40,240
I see Jinxi has been pestering you a lot lately.

299
00:14:41,040 --> 00:14:42,280
You have to be careful with him.

300
00:14:42,280 --> 00:14:43,320
I just feel

301
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:45,600
he's not as simple as he seems.

302
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:47,080
Could he be

303
00:14:47,080 --> 00:14:48,240
trying to steal

304
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:50,720
your talent

305
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:52,400
and replace you?

306
00:14:52,400 --> 00:14:53,730
How could he replace me?

307
00:14:54,920 --> 00:14:57,120
He's already the leading man.

308
00:14:58,200 --> 00:15:00,040
If he really wants to learn,

309
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:03,600
I wouldn't mind teaching him everything.

310
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:04,920
Mr. Heying,

311
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:07,840
that's so unfair to you.

312
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:10,250
For the sake of our theater troupe,

313
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:14,240
I don't mind suffering alone.

314
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:15,640
My joy and sorrow

315
00:15:17,040 --> 00:15:17,720
are all

316
00:15:18,920 --> 00:15:20,920
for our musical.

317
00:15:21,400 --> 00:15:22,440
Mr. Heying,

318
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:24,680
you're so great.

319
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:30,120
Xiaoqi,

320
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:32,160
you keep practicing.

321
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:34,600
I'll go use other equipment.

322
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:44,400
One, two, three, four.

323
00:15:44,680 --> 00:15:47,280
Five, six, seven, eight.

324
00:15:47,480 --> 00:15:49,680
Two, three, four.

325
00:15:49,680 --> 00:15:52,120
Five, six, seven, eight.

326
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:55,000
Three, two, three.

327
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:56,080
Keep it straight.

328
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:58,800
Seven, eight, four, two, three.

329
00:15:58,960 --> 00:15:59,680
Stop.

330
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:03,040
I hope everyone can be a bit more focused.

331
00:16:03,040 --> 00:16:04,370
I won't name names here.

332
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:05,730
Don't let one person

333
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:07,420
drag down the whole group.

334
00:16:07,640 --> 00:16:08,640
Let's do it again.

335
00:16:09,440 --> 00:16:11,760
Five, six, seven, eight.

336
00:16:12,160 --> 00:16:14,560
One, two, three, stop.

337
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:17,000
Let's do it again.

338
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:20,760
Go, one, two.

339
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:28,450
Take a break.

340
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:36,120
Mr. Qingsong.

341
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:40,560
Did I scare you?

342
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:42,760
No.

343
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:46,640
Do you have any issues with me?

344
00:16:46,640 --> 00:16:47,240
No.

345
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:49,280
You noticed.

346
00:16:50,800 --> 00:16:53,320
Then how should I improve myself?

347
00:16:56,920 --> 00:16:59,050
You need to improve your temperament.

348
00:16:59,640 --> 00:17:01,900
You are too undisciplined in daily life.

349
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:04,440
You are always bouncing around.

350
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:06,760
You need to be elegant.

351
00:17:07,720 --> 00:17:08,800
Look at Mr. Heying.

352
00:17:09,359 --> 00:17:10,119
Please.

353
00:17:10,400 --> 00:17:11,240
Thank you.

354
00:17:20,839 --> 00:17:21,480
Jianshe.

355
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:31,200
Jinxi,

356
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:32,440
what is it?

357
00:17:33,240 --> 00:17:33,880
Jianshe,

358
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:35,880
tomorrow is our day off.

359
00:17:36,600 --> 00:17:37,800
Do you have any plans?

360
00:17:38,120 --> 00:17:41,200
On my days off, I usually work out

361
00:17:41,640 --> 00:17:42,900
and cultivate my mind.

362
00:17:43,040 --> 00:17:43,640
Work out?

363
00:17:43,640 --> 00:17:44,960
I work out too.

364
00:17:45,120 --> 00:17:46,180
Can we go together?

365
00:17:46,400 --> 00:17:47,240
Why?

366
00:17:47,240 --> 00:17:48,760
Because I want to learn

367
00:17:48,760 --> 00:17:50,920
your elegance.

368
00:17:52,400 --> 00:17:54,060
Jinxi, you're flattering me.

369
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:55,640
You're the male lead.

370
00:17:55,760 --> 00:17:56,240
No,

371
00:17:56,400 --> 00:17:58,000
it has nothing to do with the role.

372
00:17:58,000 --> 00:17:59,800
The first time I saw you perform,

373
00:17:59,920 --> 00:18:02,040
I was deeply drawn to your acting.

374
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:03,560
I want you to teach me

375
00:18:03,560 --> 00:18:06,080
how to be a truly good actor.

376
00:18:11,720 --> 00:18:12,640
Okay.

377
00:18:15,320 --> 00:18:16,560
A strong body

378
00:18:16,600 --> 00:18:17,800
and a high spirit

379
00:18:17,800 --> 00:18:20,060
are the foundation of being a good actor.

380
00:18:20,320 --> 00:18:22,320
Do you usually work out, Jinxi?

381
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:23,920
I do work out.

382
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:26,240
I usually start with this.

383
00:18:26,440 --> 00:18:26,840
This.

384
00:18:30,240 --> 00:18:30,800
Jinxi.

385
00:18:31,360 --> 00:18:32,760
When you first start training,

386
00:18:32,760 --> 00:18:34,820
just start with the lightest weight.

387
00:18:34,920 --> 00:18:37,200
Jianshe, this is my lightest weight.

388
00:18:39,400 --> 00:18:41,320
What a coincidence. Me too.

389
00:18:44,920 --> 00:18:45,560
Come on.

390
00:18:46,560 --> 00:18:47,360
Then let's start with

391
00:18:47,360 --> 00:18:49,560
dumbbell rows.

392
00:18:49,840 --> 00:18:50,720
10 reps per set.

393
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:52,200
Starting with 5 sets.

394
00:18:53,240 --> 00:18:54,320
Okay.

395
00:18:54,960 --> 00:18:55,560
Let's go.

396
00:18:57,200 --> 00:19:02,720
One, two, three, four.

397
00:19:06,280 --> 00:19:14,320
Six, seven, eight, nine, ten.

398
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:23,440
Jianshe, let's move to the next equipment.

399
00:19:23,880 --> 00:19:24,560
Okay.

400
00:20:27,840 --> 00:20:29,680
Relax your shoulders and neck.

401
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:33,280
Keep your spine perpendicular to the floor.

402
00:20:34,320 --> 00:20:37,800
Feel the calmness of your breath.

403
00:20:39,640 --> 00:20:40,440
Sit down.

404
00:20:42,560 --> 00:20:48,120
Alright, let's begin meditation.

405
00:20:48,480 --> 00:20:49,240
Jianshe,

406
00:20:49,600 --> 00:20:50,330
are you okay?

407
00:20:51,560 --> 00:20:51,960
I...

408
00:20:51,960 --> 00:20:52,640
I'm fine.

409
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:54,440
I just did an extra set.

410
00:20:56,960 --> 00:20:57,560
Jianshe,

411
00:20:58,000 --> 00:20:59,800
why are we here practicing this?

412
00:21:03,200 --> 00:21:04,720
A great painting

413
00:21:04,720 --> 00:21:06,980
often starts with a blank sheet of paper.

414
00:21:07,320 --> 00:21:08,640
As actors,

415
00:21:08,640 --> 00:21:11,000
we must learn to empty ourselves at all times.

416
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:12,120
Just like a blank sheet of paper,

417
00:21:12,120 --> 00:21:13,560
accepting different colors,

418
00:21:13,560 --> 00:21:15,160
accepting different roles.

419
00:21:15,760 --> 00:21:16,680
And meditation

420
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:20,000
is the way I usually empty myself.

421
00:21:23,120 --> 00:21:24,180
What are you doing?

422
00:21:24,920 --> 00:21:27,640
I think everything you say is very philosophical,

423
00:21:27,640 --> 00:21:29,400
so I want to record it.

424
00:21:31,760 --> 00:21:32,240
Jin Xi,

425
00:21:32,240 --> 00:21:33,880
I was just talking casually.

426
00:21:35,200 --> 00:21:35,560
Come.

427
00:21:39,680 --> 00:21:43,400
Now inhale slowly,

428
00:21:51,720 --> 00:21:53,240
and breathe evenly.

429
00:21:53,240 --> 00:21:53,760
Jin Xi.

430
00:21:54,560 --> 00:21:55,000
Jinxi.

431
00:22:01,560 --> 00:22:03,440
Alright, today's meditation

432
00:22:03,440 --> 00:22:04,560
ends here.

433
00:22:04,720 --> 00:22:05,560
Next,

434
00:22:05,560 --> 00:22:07,960
let's do some simple stretching exercises.

435
00:22:07,960 --> 00:22:09,720
Let's have our outstanding student

436
00:22:09,720 --> 00:22:11,000
demonstrate for everyone

437
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:11,760
to see.

438
00:22:12,080 --> 00:22:13,160
Come, Heying.

439
00:22:13,840 --> 00:22:15,680
Let's forget it for today.

440
00:22:16,200 --> 00:22:17,000
What's wrong?

441
00:22:17,040 --> 00:22:18,040
What's wrong, Jianshe?

442
00:22:18,040 --> 00:22:19,370
Are you feeling unwell?

443
00:22:19,720 --> 00:22:21,280
No, I'm perfectly fine.

444
00:22:21,480 --> 00:22:22,480
Then come on up.

445
00:22:22,920 --> 00:22:24,200
Let's give him a round of applause.

446
00:22:24,200 --> 00:22:24,760
Come on.

447
00:22:28,920 --> 00:22:29,400
Come on.

448
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:32,320
Okay.

449
00:22:32,320 --> 00:22:34,640
Let's start with the downward dog pose,

450
00:22:34,640 --> 00:22:36,400
and then transition to the move I just did.

451
00:22:36,400 --> 00:22:36,730
Here.

452
00:22:38,120 --> 00:22:39,120
This way, please.

453
00:22:41,040 --> 00:22:41,760
Mr. Heying

454
00:22:41,760 --> 00:22:42,960
is one of our longtime members.

455
00:22:42,960 --> 00:22:43,840
Excellent.

456
00:22:44,240 --> 00:22:45,840
You are also the student

457
00:22:45,840 --> 00:22:47,280
with the most standard movements.

458
00:22:47,280 --> 00:22:48,440
Alright, downward dog.

459
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:49,560
Lift your hips up.

460
00:22:49,760 --> 00:22:50,840
Good, lift them up.

461
00:22:53,240 --> 00:22:54,120
What's wrong today?

462
00:22:54,120 --> 00:22:55,580
You don't seem well today.

463
00:22:56,080 --> 00:22:57,920
I'm fine.

464
00:22:57,960 --> 00:22:59,000
Lift higher.

465
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:00,360
Just do it like you usually do.

466
00:23:00,360 --> 00:23:00,800
Up.

467
00:23:00,800 --> 00:23:02,400
Lift higher.

468
00:23:03,840 --> 00:23:04,960
How did this happen?

469
00:23:04,960 --> 00:23:05,480
Jianshe.

470
00:23:05,480 --> 00:23:06,960
Are you okay?

471
00:23:06,960 --> 00:23:07,320
Jianshe.

472
00:23:07,320 --> 00:23:08,850
It's not usually like this.

473
00:23:09,120 --> 00:23:10,760
Hey, you're bleeding.

474
00:23:10,760 --> 00:23:11,840
Jianshe, get some tissues.

475
00:23:11,840 --> 00:23:12,900
I'll call for help.

476
00:23:17,440 --> 00:23:19,560
Jianshe, are you okay?

477
00:23:20,040 --> 00:23:20,840
I'm fine.

478
00:23:21,680 --> 00:23:23,610
The bleeding should have stopped.

479
00:23:24,560 --> 00:23:25,840
So where to next?

480
00:23:28,120 --> 00:23:29,720
Let's call it a day.

481
00:23:30,480 --> 00:23:32,080
You go back and get some rest.

482
00:23:33,200 --> 00:23:35,320
I thought since today is a day off,

483
00:23:35,680 --> 00:23:37,210
I'd ask you to teach me more.

484
00:23:37,840 --> 00:23:38,800
Are you tired?

485
00:23:41,000 --> 00:23:41,920
I'm not tired.

486
00:23:42,280 --> 00:23:43,160
That's great.

487
00:23:43,720 --> 00:23:45,250
Let's continue our lesson.

488
00:23:53,240 --> 00:23:53,960
Jianshe.

489
00:23:55,000 --> 00:23:57,240
Has your nose stopped bleeding?

490
00:23:57,240 --> 00:23:58,370
Don't worry, Jinxi.

491
00:23:58,560 --> 00:23:59,920
I'm fine now.

492
00:24:00,480 --> 00:24:01,210
That's good.

493
00:24:03,680 --> 00:24:06,440
Jianshe, this place is so artsy.

494
00:24:06,600 --> 00:24:07,160
Is it?

495
00:24:08,120 --> 00:24:11,000
This is where I often come to enjoy good food.

496
00:24:11,240 --> 00:24:12,800
Aren't we going to order, Jianshe?

497
00:24:12,800 --> 00:24:13,360
No need.

498
00:24:14,040 --> 00:24:15,200
When they see me,

499
00:24:15,200 --> 00:24:17,600
they know exactly what dishes to serve.

500
00:24:26,080 --> 00:24:27,010
Enjoy your meal,

501
00:24:28,120 --> 00:24:28,800
Mr. Du.

502
00:24:28,800 --> 00:24:29,400
Thank you.

503
00:24:29,760 --> 00:24:30,690
Enjoy your meal.

504
00:24:32,840 --> 00:24:34,570
Aren't we going to use cutlery?

505
00:24:34,960 --> 00:24:35,440
Jinxi,

506
00:24:36,120 --> 00:24:38,040
haven't you heard the saying

507
00:24:38,040 --> 00:24:39,370
'no eating after noon'?

508
00:24:39,720 --> 00:24:41,180
It's already evening now.

509
00:24:41,320 --> 00:24:42,640
How can we eat?

510
00:24:43,040 --> 00:24:44,920
Then why did we even come to the restaurant?

511
00:24:44,920 --> 00:24:46,600
I said I brought you here

512
00:24:46,760 --> 00:24:48,280
to savor fine food.

513
00:24:49,560 --> 00:24:50,490
Come, follow me.

514
00:24:59,040 --> 00:24:59,880
Cinnamon,

515
00:25:00,360 --> 00:25:01,360
rosemary,

516
00:25:02,280 --> 00:25:03,360
black pepper,

517
00:25:04,320 --> 00:25:06,800
and a hint of mint.

518
00:25:07,320 --> 00:25:09,980
Combined with the ingredients' own sweetness,

519
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:13,640
what a wonderful appetizer.

520
00:25:13,960 --> 00:25:14,760
Thank you.

521
00:25:33,920 --> 00:25:34,850
Enjoy your meal.

522
00:25:43,400 --> 00:25:47,320
The small yellow croaker from the South China Sea is delicious.

523
00:25:47,760 --> 00:25:50,480
The crispy fried exterior is just right.

524
00:25:50,560 --> 00:25:53,840
With the final garnish of fried garlic chips,

525
00:25:53,880 --> 00:25:56,320
all the flavors intertwine.

526
00:25:59,080 --> 00:26:00,960
What a perfect dish.

527
00:26:03,560 --> 00:26:04,280
Thank you.

528
00:26:07,400 --> 00:26:10,000
Jianshe, aren't we going to eat?

529
00:26:10,000 --> 00:26:11,720
Jinxi, don't rush.

530
00:26:12,120 --> 00:26:13,640
Soon you will be able to feel

531
00:26:13,640 --> 00:26:15,600
the touch of the food.

532
00:26:18,240 --> 00:26:19,170
Enjoy your meal.

533
00:26:20,440 --> 00:26:21,700
Wipe your hands first.

534
00:26:23,000 --> 00:26:23,600
Thank you.

535
00:26:23,760 --> 00:26:24,820
Careful, it's hot.

536
00:26:30,200 --> 00:26:31,000
Jinxi,

537
00:26:31,880 --> 00:26:33,600
do you feel this warmth?

538
00:26:35,920 --> 00:26:37,640
The richness of the broth

539
00:26:37,640 --> 00:26:40,240
combined with the burst of meat juices inside.

540
00:26:40,640 --> 00:26:41,320
Delicious.

541
00:26:41,840 --> 00:26:42,480
Tasty.

542
00:26:44,320 --> 00:26:45,080
Perfect.

543
00:26:48,760 --> 00:26:50,360
I feel like I'm already full.

544
00:26:51,000 --> 00:26:51,720
Thank you.

545
00:26:54,320 --> 00:26:54,960
Jinxi.

546
00:26:55,720 --> 00:26:57,560
Can you tell me now

547
00:26:57,960 --> 00:26:59,960
why you want to learn acting from me?

548
00:27:00,120 --> 00:27:02,880
I've actually always been really envious of you all.

549
00:27:02,880 --> 00:27:03,840
Because you've worked with

550
00:27:03,840 --> 00:27:05,570
Director Ning on so many plays.

551
00:27:06,240 --> 00:27:07,760
When the director gives an instruction,

552
00:27:07,760 --> 00:27:10,040
you can complete it quickly and accurately,

553
00:27:10,040 --> 00:27:12,200
and you can even co-create with her.

554
00:27:12,560 --> 00:27:15,160
I have an idea I want to share with the director,

555
00:27:15,320 --> 00:27:17,880
but I don't know if it's appropriate.

556
00:27:19,080 --> 00:27:20,740
What kind of idea is it, Jinxi?

557
00:27:20,840 --> 00:27:22,920
I feel like the songs in our musical

558
00:27:23,760 --> 00:27:26,320
are a bit too traditional.

559
00:27:26,560 --> 00:27:29,560
I was thinking if we could incorporate some younger,

560
00:27:29,560 --> 00:27:31,400
trendier musical styles,

561
00:27:31,480 --> 00:27:33,640
like the singles I produce myself.

562
00:27:34,120 --> 00:27:36,200
I've already made a demo

563
00:27:36,200 --> 00:27:37,920
for Ning Caichen's song myself.

564
00:27:37,920 --> 00:27:39,580
I want the director to hear it,

565
00:27:39,760 --> 00:27:41,720
but I don't know if it's appropriate.

566
00:27:41,720 --> 00:27:43,600
You mean you wrote a song

567
00:27:43,600 --> 00:27:44,960
and want to use it in our play?

568
00:27:44,960 --> 00:27:45,320
Yes.

569
00:27:46,640 --> 00:27:47,200
Jinxi.

570
00:27:47,560 --> 00:27:49,240
I think this is very in-

571
00:27:53,720 --> 00:27:54,580
-appropriate.

572
00:27:55,240 --> 00:27:56,480
Very appropriate.

573
00:27:57,000 --> 00:27:58,080
Really, Jianshe?

574
00:27:58,080 --> 00:27:58,840
Really.

575
00:27:58,880 --> 00:27:59,400
Jinxi,

576
00:27:59,840 --> 00:28:01,760
you might not know Director Ning Jin well,

577
00:28:01,760 --> 00:28:03,800
but I've known her for many years.

578
00:28:04,120 --> 00:28:05,720
She is a director who really likes it when actors

579
00:28:05,720 --> 00:28:07,360
challenge her authority.

580
00:28:07,840 --> 00:28:09,560
And the more fiercely you resist,

581
00:28:09,560 --> 00:28:10,960
the more excited she gets.

582
00:28:10,960 --> 00:28:12,020
You must remember,

583
00:28:12,120 --> 00:28:14,320
you can't feed it to her little by little.

584
00:28:14,320 --> 00:28:15,800
You have to tell her

585
00:28:15,800 --> 00:28:17,130
